    {
      "id": "important-npm3-wont-install-peerdependencies-anymore-so-if-you-havent-already-installed-jquery-you-will-get-an-unmet-peer-dependency-warning-when-you-install-to-fix-just-do-npm-install-jquery",
      "title": "IMPORTANT: npm@3 won't install peerDependencies anymore, so if you haven't already installed jQuery you will get an UNMET PEER DEPENDENCY warning when you install. To fix, just do npm install jquery.",
      "level": 5,
      "path": [
